  "original": {
    "excerpt": "For every r>=3 and 0<=lambda<=1/2, the full D_r root projection A_r=WW^T/[4(r-1)], n=2r(r-1), satisfies\n  beta_cl(A_r-lambda I)=2r(2r-1)/3-n*lambda.",
